OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian dies after collision
OL,4,Awith car on A12
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pedestrian died after he was hit by a
OL,7,Fcar on a dual carriageway in Essex on
OL,8,FSaturday evening.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,Fjunction 26 of the A12 near Colchester
OL,12,Fshortly before 17:30 GMT.
OL,14,FThe road was closed into Sunday morning
OL,15,Fin both directions between junction 26,
OL,16,Ffor Eight Ash Green/Tollgate, and
OL,17,Fjunction 28, for Colchester United's
OL,18,Fstadium. Diversions were put in place
OL,19,Fthrough the city.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
