OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian dies after collision
OL,4,Awith car on A12
OL,5,
OL,6,FEssex Police said the man, who was in
OL,7,Fhis 20s, died at the scene. Officers
OL,8,Fare appealing for anyone with dashcam
OL,9,Ffootage to come forward.
